{"symbol":"ERG.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:16Z","info":{"address1":"Chemiczna 6","city":"Dabrowa Górnicza","zip":"42-520","country":"Poland","phone":"48 322 64 02 81","website":"https://erg.com.pl","industry":"Auto Parts","industryKey":"auto-parts","industryDisp":"Auto Parts","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","sectorKey":"consumer-cyclical","sectorDisp":"Consumer Cyclical","longBusinessSummary":"ERG Spólka Akcyjna manufactures and sells plastic products and polyethylene films products in Poland. It operates through three segments: Plastic Products, Commercial Activities, and Other. It offers bags and hoods, liner and separator sheets, shrink films, box and carton liners, films for frozen products, box and cardboard films, films for FFS packaging machines, perforated film for cooking, and paperlike films; films for printing and lamination; lamination film with PR foam, film for underfloor heating, film for torch-on felt, film for mineral wool, and big bag liners; pellet and eco-pea coal films; LDPE films, EVA films, and embossed films; release liner films and masking and protection films; draw tape for bags; and film with permanent antistatic additives. The company also provides films with added recyclate, film from renewable raw material, and biodegradable materials. It serves the food and beverage, printing and lamination, construction, fuel, rubber/natural rubber, automotive, furniture, hygiene, and funeral sectors. The company also exports its products. The company was founded in 1896 and is based in Dabrowa Górnicza, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":121,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Grzegorz  Tajak","title":"President of the Management Board & CEO","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tomasz  Gwizda","title":"Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Maria  Purgal","title":"Secretary of the Supervisory Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAg